<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - US Airways raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - US Airways raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it upgraded US Airways Group Inc to outperform from netural.</p>
<p>-- cited strong operating results and growing confidence the company will strike an accord with pilots.</p>
<p>-- said raised 1997 earnings estimate to $3.50 a share from $2.25 a share. Also raised the first quarter 1997 estimate to breakeven, from a loss of $0.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- US Airways remained unchanged at 25-3/8 in late morning exchange trade.</p>
</text>
